      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 10,
      "end_line": 12,
      "raw": "- `whatson_build_regression` builds the maintained product binaries and the regression test executable in `build/`.\n- `whatson_cpp_regression` runs the runtime C++ regression assertions only.\n- `whatson_regression` is the default combined verification gate.\n",
      "items": [
